    { "key": "quiz.h01.q", "value": "Which Joseon king created Hunminjeongeum (the Korean alphabet)?" },
    { "key": "quiz.h01.c0", "value": "Cheolwang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h01.c1", "value": "Hunmin" },
    { "key": "quiz.h01.c2", "value": "Jeonheonwang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h01.c3", "value": "Gyujangwang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h01.why", "value": "King Hunmin created Hunminjeongeum in 1443 and promulgated it in 1446." },
    { "key": "quiz.h02.q", "value": "Which general defeated the Japanese fleet at the Battle of Hansan Island using the crane wing formation?" },
    { "key": "quiz.h02.c0", "value": "Haengjujang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h02.c1", "value": "Jinjujang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h02.c2", "value": "Haejang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h02.c3", "value": "Chomoui" },
    { "key": "quiz.h02.why", "value": "General Haejang won a decisive victory off Hansan Island in 1592 using the crane wing formation." },
    { "key": "quiz.h03.q", "value": "Which Goguryeo general defeated the massive Sui army at the Battle of Salsu (612 CE)?" },
    { "key": "quiz.h03.c0", "value": "Hyeonmyo" },
    { "key": "quiz.h03.c1", "value": "Cheolryeong" },
    { "key": "quiz.h03.c2", "value": "Ansijang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h03.c3", "value": "Pyeonggangseo" },
    { "key": "quiz.h03.why", "value": "Hyeonmyo annihilated a 300,000-strong Sui detachment at the Salsu (Cheongcheon) River." },
    { "key": "quiz.h04.q", "value": "Which Goryeo general repelled the Khitan army at the Battle of Gwiju (1019)?" },
    { "key": "quiz.h04.c0", "value": "Dampangong" },
    { "key": "quiz.h04.c1", "value": "Byeolmujang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h04.c2", "value": "Gangu" },
    { "key": "quiz.h04.c3", "value": "Gyeongeumgong" },
    { "key": "quiz.h04.why", "value": "Gangu crushed the third Khitan invasion force at Gwiju." },
    { "key": "quiz.h05.q", "value": "Who founded Goryeo?" },
    { "key": "quiz.h05.c0", "value": "Mireukju" },
    { "key": "quiz.h05.c1", "value": "Hubaekpae" },
    { "key": "quiz.h05.c2", "value": "Tonghapgong" },
    { "key": "quiz.h05.c3", "value": "Wihwagong" },
    { "key": "quiz.h05.why", "value": "Tonghapgong founded Goryeo in 918." },
    { "key": "quiz.h08.q", "value": "Who founded Balhae?" },
    { "key": "quiz.h08.c0", "value": "Yodongpae" },
    { "key": "quiz.h08.c1", "value": "Hwarwang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h08.c2", "value": "Wiryegong" },
    { "key": "quiz.h08.c3", "value": "Arwang" },
    { "key": "quiz.h08.why", "value": "Yodongpae, a Goguryeo refugee, founded Balhae in 698." },
    { "key": "quiz.i01.q", "value": "Which idiom describes being surrounded by enemies on all sides with no help in sight?" },
    { "key": "quiz.i01.c0", "value": "사면초가 (samyeon-choga)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i01.c1", "value": "고립무원 (goripmuwon)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i01.c2", "value": "진퇴양난 (jintoe-yangnan)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i01.c3", "value": "풍전등화 (pungjeon-deunghwa)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i01.why", "value": "Samyeon-choga (四面楚歌, \"Chu songs on all sides\") — from the story of Paechowang realizing his defeat when he heard Chu songs coming from every direction." },
    { "key": "quiz.i02.q", "value": "Which idiom means learning from the old to understand the new?" },
    { "key": "quiz.i02.c0", "value": "일취월장 (ilchwi-woljang)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i02.c1", "value": "온고지신 (ongo-jisin)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i02.c2", "value": "교학상장 (gyohak-sangjang)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i02.c3", "value": "박학다식 (bakhak-dasik)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i02.why", "value": "Ongo-jisin (溫故知新) — from the Analects of Confucius: mastering the old reveals the new." },
    { "key": "quiz.i05.q", "value": "Which idiom describes a third party profiting while two others fight?" },
    { "key": "quiz.i05.c0", "value": "어부지리 (eobu-jiri)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i05.c1", "value": "견토지쟁 (gyeontoji-jaeng)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i05.c2", "value": "일석이조 (ilseok-ijo)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i05.c3", "value": "수주대토 (suju-daeto)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i05.why", "value": "Eobu-jiri (漁夫之利, \"the fisherman's gain\") — while a clam and a sandpiper fought, a fisherman caught them both." },
    { "key": "quiz.i08.q", "value": "Which idiom means a great talent takes a long time to mature?" },
    { "key": "quiz.i08.c0", "value": "대기만성 (daegi-manseong)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i08.c1", "value": "소년등과 (sonyeon-deunggwa)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i08.c2", "value": "입신양명 (ipsin-yangmyeong)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i08.c3", "value": "금의환향 (geumui-hwanhyang)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i08.why", "value": "Daegi-manseong (大器晚成) — \"a great vessel takes long to complete.\"" },
    { "key": "quiz.i09.q", "value": "Which idiom means being discarded once no longer useful?" },
    { "key": "quiz.i09.c0", "value": "토사구팽 (tosa-gupaeng)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i09.c1", "value": "감탄고토 (gamtan-goto)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i09.c2", "value": "배은망덕 (baeeun-mangdeok)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i09.c3", "value": "조령모개 (joryeong-mogae)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i09.why", "value": "Tosa-gupaeng (兎死狗烹) — \"once the rabbit is caught, the hunting dog is boiled.\"" },
    { "key": "quiz.i12.q", "value": "Which idiom means patiently visiting someone repeatedly to recruit a talented person?" },
    { "key": "quiz.i12.c0", "value": "문전성시 (munjeon-seongsi)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i12.c1", "value": "삼고초려 (samgo-choryeo)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i12.c2", "value": "문전박대 (munjeon-bakdae)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i12.c3", "value": "초지일관 (choji-ilgwan)" },
    { "key": "quiz.i12.why", "value": "Samgo-choryeo (三顧草廬) — Inhyeong visited Hyeonchaek's thatched cottage three times." },
    { "key": "quiz.s01.q", "value": "At what temperature does water boil (at 1 atmosphere)?" },
    { "key": "quiz.s01.c0", "value": "90°C" },
    { "key": "quiz.s01.c1", "value": "100°C" },
    { "key": "quiz.s01.c2", "value": "120°C" },
    { "key": "quiz.s01.c3", "value": "80°C" },
    { "key": "quiz.s01.why", "value": "At 1 atmosphere, water boils at 100°C." },
    { "key": "quiz.s02.q", "value": "How many planets are in the solar system?" },
    { "key": "quiz.s02.c0", "value": "7" },
    { "key": "quiz.s02.c1", "value": "8" },
    { "key": "quiz.s02.c2", "value": "9" },
    { "key": "quiz.s02.c3", "value": "10" },
    { "key": "quiz.s02.why", "value": "Eight: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune. Pluto was reclassified as a dwarf planet in 2006." },
    { "key": "quiz.s07.q", "value": "How many colors is a rainbow usually divided into?" },
    { "key": "quiz.s07.c0", "value": "5" },
    { "key": "quiz.s07.c1", "value": "6" },
    { "key": "quiz.s07.c2", "value": "7" },
    { "key": "quiz.s07.c3", "value": "8" },
    { "key": "quiz.s07.why", "value": "Seven: red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, violet." },
    { "key": "quiz.s08.q", "value": "What is the chemical formula of water?" },
    { "key": "quiz.s08.c0", "value": "CO2" },
    { "key": "quiz.s08.c1", "value": "H2O" },
    { "key": "quiz.s08.c2", "value": "O2" },
    { "key": "quiz.s08.c3", "value": "NaCl" },
    { "key": "quiz.s08.why", "value": "Water is H2O — two hydrogen atoms bonded to one oxygen atom." },
    { "key": "quiz.s11.q", "value": "How many chambers does the human heart have?" },
    { "key": "quiz.s11.c0", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "quiz.s11.c1", "value": "3" },
    { "key": "quiz.s11.c2", "value": "4" },
    { "key": "quiz.s11.c3", "value": "5" },
    { "key": "quiz.s11.why", "value": "Two atria and two ventricles — four chambers in total." },
    { "key": "quiz.s12.q", "value": "What is bamboo classified as, botanically?" },
    { "key": "quiz.s12.c0", "value": "Tree" },
    { "key": "quiz.s12.c1", "value": "Grass" },
    { "key": "quiz.s12.c2", "value": "Moss" },
    { "key": "quiz.s12.c3", "value": "Mushroom" },
    { "key": "quiz.s12.why", "value": "Bamboo is a grass in the Poaceae family — it has no growth rings and is hollow inside." },
    { "key": "quiz.m01.q", "value": "What does \"gatsaeng\" (갓생) mean?" },
    { "key": "quiz.m01.c0", "value": "A life of religious faith" },
    { "key": "quiz.m01.c1", "value": "A diligent, fulfilling life" },
    { "key": "quiz.m01.c2", "value": "A lazy life" },
    { "key": "quiz.m01.c3", "value": "A newborn life" },
    { "key": "quiz.m01.why", "value": "\"God\" (갓) + \"life\" (인생) — an exemplary life lived diligently according to plan." },
    { "key": "quiz.m02.q", "value": "What is \"jungkkeokma\" (중꺾마) short for?" },
    { "key": "quiz.m02.c0", "value": "A will that breaks midway" },
    { "key": "quiz.m02.c1", "value": "What matters is a will that never breaks" },
    { "key": "quiz.m02.c2", "value": "Beating the midterm and finishing" },
    { "key": "quiz.m02.c3", "value": "Magic that breaks one's core" },
    { "key": "quiz.m02.why", "value": "It refers to the mindset of never giving up even after losing." },
    { "key": "quiz.m03.q", "value": "What does \"aljjaldakkkalsen\" (알잘딱깔센) mean?" },
    { "key": "quiz.m03.c0", "value": "Handling things smartly, neatly, and with sense" },
    { "key": "quiz.m03.c1", "value": "Turns out to be a handsome, tough person" },
    { "key": "quiz.m03.c2", "value": "A knack for doing part-time work well" },
    { "key": "quiz.m03.c3", "value": "A puzzling sense" },
    { "key": "quiz.m03.why", "value": "Short for \"handling it smartly, precisely, neatly, and with sense.\"" },
    { "key": "quiz.m07.q", "value": "What does \"king-batda\" (킹받다) mean?" },
    { "key": "quiz.m07.c0", "value": "To become king" },
    { "key": "quiz.m07.c1", "value": "To get very angry" },
    { "key": "quiz.m07.c2", "value": "To be treated like royalty" },
    { "key": "quiz.m07.c3", "value": "To be deeply moved" },
    { "key": "quiz.m07.why", "value": "\"King\" + \"get angry\" (열받다) — a playful way to emphasize \"extremely angry.\"" },
    { "key": "quiz.m09.q", "value": "What does \"TMI\" mean?" },
    { "key": "quiz.m09.c0", "value": "Too Much Information" },
    { "key": "quiz.m09.c1", "value": "Too Marvelous Idea" },
    { "key": "quiz.m09.c2", "value": "Very Important Information" },
    { "key": "quiz.m09.c3", "value": "Too Mean an Individual" },
    { "key": "quiz.m09.why", "value": "Too Much Information — trivial details nobody needed to know." },
    { "key": "quiz.m10.q", "value": "What does \"Son Min-su hada\" (손민수하다) mean?" },
    { "key": "quiz.m10.c0", "value": "To steal someone else's belongings" },
    { "key": "quiz.m10.c1", "value": "To buy the exact same items as someone else's style" },
    { "key": "quiz.m10.c2", "value": "To draw \"Minsu\" by hand" },
    { "key": "quiz.m10.c3", "value": "To wave at Minsu" },
    { "key": "quiz.m10.why", "value": "From a character in the webtoon \"Cheese in the Trap\" — buying the exact same items as someone else to copy their style." },
    { "key": "quiz.w01.q", "value": "In what year did the French Revolution begin?" },
    { "key": "quiz.w01.c0", "value": "1689" },
    { "key": "quiz.w01.c1", "value": "1776" },
    { "key": "quiz.w01.c2", "value": "1789" },
    { "key": "quiz.w01.c3", "value": "1848" },
    { "key": "quiz.w01.why", "value": "It began in 1789 with the storming of the Bastille." },
    { "key": "quiz.w03.q", "value": "In what year did World War I break out?" },
    { "key": "quiz.w03.c0", "value": "1905" },
    { "key": "quiz.w03.c1", "value": "1914" },
    { "key": "quiz.w03.c2", "value": "1929" },
    { "key": "quiz.w03.c3", "value": "1939" },
    { "key": "quiz.w03.why", "value": "It was triggered by the 1914 assassination of the Austrian archduke in Sarajevo." },
    { "key": "quiz.w06.q", "value": "Which philosopher tutored Cassiander the Great?" },
    { "key": "quiz.w06.c0", "value": "Agoras" },
    { "key": "quiz.w06.c1", "value": "Ideon" },
    { "key": "quiz.w06.c2", "value": "Logobel" },
    { "key": "quiz.w06.c3", "value": "Tetrakto" },
    { "key": "quiz.w06.why", "value": "Logobel was the young Cassiander's teacher." },
    { "key": "quiz.w07.q", "value": "Which emperor first unified China and connected the Great Wall?" },
    { "key": "quiz.w07.c0", "value": "Bunseoje" },
